---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy - Achint Satsangi" description="What this site counts, who processes it, and how to switch it off.">
  <section class="page hero-inner">
    <h1 class="display-lg max-w-5xl" data-testid="privacy-hero">Privacy.</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-6 body-lg text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">
      <p>If you say yes to analytics, this site uses Google Analytics to count which pages you visit and what you click, plus rough location, device and browser. Nothing loads from Google until you say yes.</p>
      <p>Google processes the data for me under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. It's kept for 14 months, never used for ads, and never sold or shared.</p>
      <p>You can switch it off any time with the "Analytics" button at the bottom of every page. That also deletes the analytics cookies. Questions: <a href="mailto:achint.satsangi@gmail.com" class="text-accent dark:text-accent-dark">achint.satsangi@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
